{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:06.88] Ballin' like prime time\n[00:08.94] Girl, I'm really trying to get you on my time\n[00:13.76] (TheBeatAsylum)\n[00:14.72] Ballin' like prime time\n[00:22.26] Girl, I'm really trying to get you on my time\n[00:23.78] Yeah, I like that (Joey Rock Marley)\n[Chorus]\n[00:25.30] Ballin' like prime time\n[00:26.84] Girl, I'm really trying to get you on my time\n[00:29.86] Girl, I really can't get you off my mind\n[00:32.52] It's been a while since we last spoke, funny how time flies\n[00:36.44] I don't really like how time flies\n[00:39.06] I remember when I was a good guy, now she think that I'm a bad guy\n[00:42.82] I was just caught up in the fast life\n[00:45.10] I remember I was taking my time, felt like I was in the past life\n[Verse 1]\n[00:49.28] I'm in my prime, bae, ain't taking my time, no, I ain't taking my time\n[00:54.50] All in my mind, bae, all in my mind, you're still all in my mind\n[00:56.54] I've been out of my mind, I've been out of my mind\n[00:58.64] Feeling like I'm running out of time\n[00:59.74] Feeling like I'm living a lie\n[01:00.72] I've been out of my mind, bae\n[Bridge]\n[01:01.62] Drugs getting harder to find\n[01:02.76] Maybe it's a sign of the times, bae\n[01:04.06] I've been out of my mind\n[Chorus]\n[01:05.42] Ballin' like prime time\n[01:06.34] Girl, I'm really trying to get you on my time\n[01:07.48] Girl, I really can't get you off my mind\n[01:08.50] It's been a while since we last spoke, funny how time flies\n[01:09.98] I don't really like how time flies\n[01:10.96] I remember when I was a good guy, now she think that I'm a bad guy\n[01:13.88] I was just caught up in the fast life\n[01:15.10] I remember I was taking my time, felt like I was in the past life\n[Interlude]\n[01:22.80] So this part, I'm finna breathe, you can like cut my voice out and shit\n[01:27.38] (Drink more water, styrofoam with the soda)\n[01:29.06] (Drink more water, styrofoam with the soda)\n[01:30.60] Just to get they fuckin' a